    "description": "| Vulnerability | Severity | Title |\n|---|---|---|\n| [` CVE-2020-28500 `](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2020-28500) | medium | ` nodejs-lodash: ReDoS via the toNumber, trim and trimEnd functions ` |\n| [` CVE-2021-23337 `](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2021-23337) | high | ` nodejs-lodash: command injection via template ` |\n| [` CVE-2025-13465 `](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-13465) | medium | ` lodash: prototype pollution in _.unset and _.omit functions ` |\n| [` CVE-2026-4800 `](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-4800) | high | ` lodash: lodash: Arbitrary code execution via untrusted input in template imports ` |\n\n**Versions:** ` 4.17.20 ` → ` 4.18.0 ` in ` package-lock.json `\n\n- ` package-lock.json `: direct\n\n**New in the lockfile:**\n- ` package-lock.json `: ` lodash@4.18.0 `\n\n[Vulnerabilities in Qualor](https://ado.example.invalid/projects/585f2324-79c3-47f6-8148-fa6e000045c7/vulnerabilities?view=vulnerability)\n\nQualor keeps this PR current and closes it when the vulnerability is gone. Push to this branch to take it over.",
